<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BOLIVIA AND COLOMBIA DRAW 2-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOLIVIA AND COLOMBIA DRAW 2-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia and Colombia drew 2-2 (halftime 2-1) in a World Cup South American qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Bolivia - Marcos Sandy (15), Jaime Moreno (44).</p>
<p>Colombia - Mauricio Serna (40 penalty), Freddy Rincon (54).</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000.</p>
</text>
